Original microphone fixture

The transcript, audio and metadata for this fixture are distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later. The license text is in clean-english-v2.COPYING. The
editable source is original-microphone-v1.txt. The original sentence was
rendered to a file with the en-us eSpeak NG formant voice. The WAV contains
no recorded person. It is used only in development.

eSpeak NG is copyright Jonathan Duddington, Reece H. Dunn and the eSpeak NG
contributors and is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. The upstream source
archive, commit, checksums and voice-data identities are recorded in
original-microphone-v1.json. From this fixture directory, run the command
listed there with eSpeak NG 1.52.0 to regenerate the mono PCM16 WAV.
